From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:31:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 41/57] Close all, Close others, Close tabs to the right

File menu entries (Close all tabs: Ctrl+Shift+W) and a right-click menu
on the tab bar. Clean, compare and git diff tabs close at once; tabs
with unsaved changes get one prompt listing them with Save all, Discard
all and Cancel. Cancel closes nothing. Save all asks Save As for each
untitled tab in turn and stops if one is cancelled. Discard all drops
the drafts like Discard on one tab. Closing every tab leaves one new
empty tab.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

